---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="Whimsy Central's Amazon affiliate disclosure."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-6">
      Affiliate Disclosure
    </h1>

    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
      Whimsy Central is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates
      Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means
      for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to
      Amazon.com.
    </p>

    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mt-4">
      In plain language: when you click a "View on Amazon" link on this site
      and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a small commission — at no
      additional cost to you. The price you pay is exactly the same whether
      you use our link or go to Amazon directly.
    </p>

    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mt-4">
      We only feature things we genuinely think are useless in the best way,
      beautiful, or worth reading. Product prices and images are added by us
      and may not always reflect Amazon's current listing — always check the
      Amazon product page for up-to-date pricing and availability before
      purchasing.
    </p>

    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mt-4">
      Thank you for supporting Whimsy Central this way.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
